From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 10:32:26 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Agent0067 full V1: audit fixes on top of PR #1

- Terminal: kernel commands typed in a device console tab now run in the
  kernel tab (with a note) instead of dead-ending in "% Unknown command";
  `exit` from privileged mode ends the device session like IOS.
- Canvas: placing a device highlights it without yanking the terminal into
  its console; tapping/double-clicking a device still opens its console tab.
- env shows every .env key masked (...xxxx), not just a count.
- verify: names an unknown device instead of silently falling back;
  `verify all` prints its confirm note once; ping detail is "5/5 replies, N hop(s)"
  (JS + Python kept in parity).
- Phase 5 gains an email objective, so the guided flow performs an approved
  write against all five systems.
- tests: every one of the 17 tools is called over MCP and must return
  structured data (no "Unknown tool").
- guides/06-ship.md + BUILD.md: Netlify runtime re-checked Nov 9, 2026.
- Cache-bust assets (?v=7).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
